    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immerse yourself in the gloomy atmosphere of creepy Puzzles! This game offers a collection of atmospheric and intense puzzles created for those who like to tickle their nerves. Discover a world of frightening images captured in dozens of fragments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Put the nightmare back together! Drag and drop the puzzle elements into place, step by step recreating the whole horror picture. The simple and intuitive gameplay will require not only attention to detail, but also strong nerves. Challenge the time by collecting speed puzzles and try to beat your own records!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 24 chilling puzzles: Discover a variety of dark and frightening scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Extremely simple gameplay: Intuitive controls - focus on the build and atmosphere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2022 Ominous soundtrack: Immerse yourself in a creepy atmosphere with dark music and sounds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to collect your fear? Start now!</p>",
